{"kind": "mod", "id": 2711, "name": "Better OKP-7", "slug": "better-okp-7", "teaser": "New OKP-7 reticles for both the Dovetail and Picatinny varients!", "owner_name": "probablyEukyre", "downloads": 2826, "favourites": 21, "featured": false, "contains_ads": true, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.eukyre.betterokp7", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Equipment", "category_id": 15, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:04:07.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-05-31T14:52:52.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-05-31T14:46:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.13", "latest_version": "1.0.1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Eukyre’s Better OKP-7 is a mod designed around <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/170/better-okp-7\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SamSWAT’s old name of the same monacre</a>. Designed with the purpose of making the EBK OKP-7 optics (both Dovetail and Picatinny) have a selection of reticles to choose from for the user’s convenience.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download Eukyre-BetterOKP7-1.0.0.7z</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded .7z file in 7-zip.</li>\n<li>Drag the contents of the .7z file into your base SPT directory.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"Install GIF\" /></li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Showcase</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SGi4te6.png\" alt=\"Showcase\" />\nBetter OKP-7 adds a selection of 3 reticles to the optics, those being the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Simple Dot</strong> - Classic, easy to use and good for target acquisition.</li>\n<li><strong>Dot with a Ring</strong> - Similar to what BSG had before, but without the extra ring that doesn’t actually exist on these optics.</li>\n<li><strong>The Cross</strong> - The Iconic OKP-7 reticle that everyone loves, and is preferred overall by Tarkov Players.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can see these optics in use with the GIF below:\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tHcpiGF.gif\" alt=\"A GIF showcasing BetterOKP-7 in action\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Huge thanks to QwertyAlex for helping me figure out some of the C# code required to make this. mod actually work, cheers lad!</p>\n<p>Check out the WTT Discord server <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/hKRbR6yvf2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p>\n<p>If you want to, you can support my work on my Ko-Fi page, found <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mapledesigns\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.10", "content_length": null, "downloads": 578, "published_at": "2026-05-31T14:54:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2711/better-okp-7/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.13", "content_length": 4183536, "downloads": 2248, "published_at": "2026-06-02T13:15:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2711/better-okp-7/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/eukyre/Eukyre-BetterOKP7", "label": "GitHub"}]}